-- תקנון שירות עובדי הוראה, פרק 1א', §1.15 תמריצים
-- The incentives for teaching and education staff in national-priority
-- areas: who is eligible, the five incentives and their amounts, the
-- deadlines, and the lists of localities (§1.15.2).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

-- Time in this file is counted in DAYS from 1 September 2003 (day 0), the
-- date ¶8 and §1.2 give for the system, except where a rule says otherwise.
-- The dates the section prints, as day numbers:
`1 September 2002` MEANS -365
`15 July 2003`     MEANS -48
`1 September 2003` MEANS 0
`31 December 2003` MEANS 121
`1 January 2004`   MEANS 122
`15 June 2004`     MEANS 288
`31 August 2004`   MEANS 365

§ `1.15 תמריצים`

-- akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15/p2 The page's table-of-contents heading ("תכני העמוד"); no rule.
-- akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15/p3 A table-of-contents entry for §1.15.1; no rule.
-- akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15/p4 A table-of-contents entry for §1.15.2; no rule.
-- akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15/p5 The heading of §1.15.1; no rule.
-- akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15/p6 An amendment note (updated 06.01.04); no rule.
-- akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15/p7 The heading of part 1 ("כללי"); no rule.

§§ `1.15.1 כללי`

-- F-1.15-a: ¶8 names the school year התשס"ג and dates it "ד' באלול
-- התשס"ב 1.9.2003"; but 1.9.2003 opens the school year the rest of the
-- section's rules call התשס"ד (§1.2, the request deadline, the rent and
-- fund rules). The reading adopted: the system operates from 1.9.2003
-- (day 0), the Gregorian date §1.2 repeats.
@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15/p8
GIVEN `day` IS A NUMBER @desc days from 1 September 2003
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the incentives system operates on` `day` IF
    `day` AT LEAST `1 September 2003`

@desc The school year a date falls in, by the first calendar year it spans (2003 = התשס"ד, 2002 = התשס"ג).
DECLARE `school year` IS ONE OF
    `the school year התשס"ג`
    `the school year התשס"ד`

`the school year ¶8 names` MEANS `the school year התשס"ג`

-- A school year opens on 1 September (common.l4's school month); ¶8's
-- date, 1.9.2003, opens the year the rest of the section calls התשס"ד.
GIVEN `day` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `school year`
DECIDE `the school year of` `day` IS
    IF `day` AT LEAST `1 September 2003` THEN `the school year התשס"ד` ELSE `the school year התשס"ג`

`the school year ¶8's date opens differs from the year ¶8 names` MEANS
    NOT (`the school year of` `1 September 2003` EQUALS `the school year ¶8 names`)
#ASSERT `the school year ¶8's date opens differs from the year ¶8 names`

-- ¶8 announces "שלוש קטגוריות כדלקמן" and lists §1.1 and §1.2.
DECLARE `incentives category` IS ONE OF
    @ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_1_1
    `maximal benefits in national-priority zone A`
    @ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_1_2
    `incentives cancelled in localities no longer development localities`

`the number of categories ¶8 announces` MEANS 3

`the categories ¶8 lists` MEANS
    LIST `maximal benefits in national-priority zone A`,
         `incentives cancelled in localities no longer development localities`

-- F-1.15-b: three categories are announced, two follow.
`¶8 lists fewer categories than it announces` MEANS
    count `the categories ¶8 lists` LESS THAN `the number of categories ¶8 announces`
#ASSERT `¶8 lists fewer categories than it announces`

§§ `1.15.1 §1.1`

-- §1.1 points at "נספח א להלן"; no row is headed "נספח א", and the list
-- headed "אזור עדיפות לאומית א'" in §1.15.2 (beside "נספח ב") is read as
-- it. The benefits themselves are the five of §4 below.
@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_1_1
GIVEN `locality` IS A STRING @desc a locality's name as §1.15.2 prints it
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the maximal benefits apply in` `locality` IF
    `in national-priority zone A` `locality`

§§ `1.15.1 §1.2`

-- §1.2 cancels from 1.9.03 the incentives of VETERAN staff in localities
-- once counted among development towns and areas and no longer counted.
-- Its list "מובאת בסעיף 1.15.2": read as annex B (the cancelled zone B),
-- the only list there of localities no longer included. "ותיקים" is not
-- defined (F-1.15-c): whether the staff member is a veteran is an input.
@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_1_2
GIVEN `locality` IS A STRING
      `veteran` IS A BOOLEAN @desc whether the staff member is "ותיק" (F-1.15-c: undefined in the takanon)
      `day` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `cancelled under §1.2` `locality` `veteran` `day` IF
        `veteran`
    AND `in the cancelled zone B` `locality`
    AND `day` AT LEAST `1 September 2003`
    AND NOT `continued by the court rulings` `locality` `veteran` `day`

-- The National Labour Court rulings of 17.09.03 and 14.12.03: veterans in
-- those localities keep, for school year התשס"ד, the incentives they are
-- entitled to (the incentives themselves are those of the earlier rules,
-- which this section does not restate: an input wherever they are priced).
@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_1_2/p2 akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_1_2/p3 akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_1_2/p4
GIVEN `locality` IS A STRING
      `veteran` IS A BOOLEAN
      `day` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `continued by the court rulings` `locality` `veteran` `day` IF
        `veteran`
    AND `in the cancelled zone B` `locality`
    AND `the school year of` `day` EQUALS `the school year התשס"ד`
    AND `day` AT MOST `31 August 2004`

-- F-1.15-c: the section defines "מוסמך" and "מורים צפוניים" and no other
-- term; "ותיקים", which decides §1.2, is not among them.
`the terms §1.15 defines` MEANS LIST "מוסמך", "מורים צפוניים"
`§1.15 does not define "ותיקים"` MEANS
    NOT elem "ותיקים" `the terms §1.15 defines`
#ASSERT `§1.15 does not define "ותיקים"`

§§ `1.15.1 part 2 Requests`

-- akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_1_2/p5 The heading of part 2 ("לוח זמנים להגשת בקשות"); no rule.

@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_1_2/p6
GIVEN `issued before this information` IS A BOOLEAN @desc the notice on incentives in national-priority areas predates this one
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an earlier notice on the incentives still governs` `issued before this information` IF
    NOT `issued before this information`

DECLARE `incentive kind` IS ONE OF
    `seniority advancement`
    `academic tuition participation`
    `rent participation`
    `training-fund contributions`
    `sabbatical travel reimbursement`

DECLARE `incentives action` IS ONE OF
    `submit an incentives request to the district office`
    `notify the district incentives department in writing of a change`
    `notify the teacher that the incentives are cancelled without the division's approval`
    `pay a rent instalment` HAS `rent instalment paid` IS A NUMBER
    `notify the fund and the division in writing of a change`
    `submit the northern teacher's request`

-- "למעט קרנות ההשתלמות (ראה 4.4 ד' להלן) והחזר נסיעות בשבתון (ראה 4.5
-- ,הערה ד')": the two kinds keep their own deadlines. F-1.15-f: 4.4ד is the
-- age-53 paragraph; the funds' deadline is in 4.4ה's third paragraph.
GIVEN `kind` IS AN `incentive kind`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `outside the general deadline` `kind` IF
    CONSIDER `kind`
    WHEN `training-fund contributions` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `sabbatical travel reimbursement` THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_1_2/p7
GIVEN `kind` IS AN `incentive kind`
      `day filed` IS A NUMBER @desc days from 1 September 2003
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the division handles the request` `kind` `day filed` IF
    `outside the general deadline` `kind` OR `day filed` AT MOST `15 June 2004`

-- The duty itself: the request goes to the district office at the start of
-- the year; the division will not handle one filed after 15 June 2004.
GIVEN `kind` IS AN `incentive kind`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `incentives action`
DECIDE `the request for the year` `kind` IS
    IF `outside the general deadline` `kind`
    THEN FULFILLED
    ELSE PARTY `the teaching employee`
         MUST  `submit an incentives request to the district office`
         WITHIN `15 June 2004`
         LEST BREACH BY `the teaching employee` BECAUSE "§1.15.1 part 2: the division does not handle requests filed after 15 June 2004"

-- F-1.15-f: the paragraphs of 4.4 that state a request deadline.
DECLARE `paragraph of 4.4` IS ONE OF `4.4 א`, `4.4 ב`, `4.4 ג`, `4.4 ד`, `4.4 ה`

GIVEN `p` IS A `paragraph of 4.4`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `states a request deadline` `p` IF
    CONSIDER `p`
    WHEN `4.4 ה` THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

`the paragraph ¶7 points to for the funds' deadline` MEANS `4.4 ד`

`¶7 points to a paragraph of 4.4 that states no deadline` MEANS
    NOT `states a request deadline` `the paragraph ¶7 points to for the funds' deadline`
#ASSERT `¶7 points to a paragraph of 4.4 that states no deadline`

-- akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_1_2/p8 The heading "הערות"; no rule.
-- akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_1_2/p22 The heading "הערות" again: the eight notes are printed twice in the section, after part 2 and after part 3; both copies are cited on the rule each encodes.

§§ `1.15.1 part 3 Who is eligible`

-- akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_1_2/p17 The heading of part 3 ("הזכאים לתמריצים"); no rule.

@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_1_2/p18
DECLARE `grading` IS ONE OF
    `the teaching-staff grading`
    `the academic grading`
    `another grading`

DECLARE `education role` IS ONE OF
    `supervisor`
    `school principal`
    `teacher`
    `kindergarten teacher`
    `instructor`
    `community-centre worker`
    `education worker of an authority or owning body`
    `informal-education worker`
    `educational psychologist`
    `another role`

DECLARE `level taught` IS ONE OF
    `primary education`
    `post-primary education`
    `no teaching level`

DECLARE `kind of employer` IS ONE OF
    `the Ministry directly`
    `a post-primary owning body within the profile`
    `a body of recognised education`
    `another employer`

@desc A teaching or education staff member, as far as section 1.15 asks about them.
DECLARE `incentives claimant` HAS
    `claimant grading`             IS A `grading`
    `claimant role`                IS AN `education role`
    `claimant teaches at`          IS A `level taught`
    `holds a primary teaching certificate`            IS A BOOLEAN
    `holds a permanent post-primary teaching licence` IS A BOOLEAN
    `holds a teaching certificate` IS A BOOLEAN
    `holds an academic degree`     IS A BOOLEAN
    `locality of residence`        IS A STRING @desc as §1.15.2 prints the name
    `locality of work`             IS A STRING @desc as §1.15.2 prints the name
    `employed by`                  IS A `kind of employer`
    `appears in the school profile` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the department head decides the claimant eligible` IS A BOOLEAN @desc the head of the housing-and-incentives department's decision under note 1, where residence and work are in two zone-A localities
    `lowest position fraction in the year` IS A NUMBER @desc the smallest share of a full position held at any time in the school year
    `annual position fraction`     IS A NUMBER @desc the share of an annual position held over the school year
    `claimant is a veteran`        IS A BOOLEAN @desc "ותיק" under §1.2 (F-1.15-c: undefined)

GIVEN c IS AN `incentives claimant`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in a group the incentives cover` c IF
    CONSIDER c's `claimant grading`
    WHEN `the teaching-staff grading` THEN
        NOT (c's `claimant role` EQUALS `educational psychologist`
             OR c's `claimant role` EQUALS `another role`
             OR c's `claimant role` EQUALS `informal-education worker`)
    WHEN `the academic grading` THEN c's `claimant role` EQUALS `educational psychologist`
    OTHERWISE FALSE

-- "מורה 'מוסמך'": a primary teaching certificate, or a permanent
-- post-primary licence, for the level the claimant teaches.
@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_1_2/p19
GIVEN c IS AN `incentives claimant`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `qualified for the level taught` c IF
    CONSIDER c's `claimant teaches at`
    WHEN `primary education`      THEN c's `holds a primary teaching certificate`
    WHEN `post-primary education` THEN c's `holds a permanent post-primary teaching licence`
    OTHERWISE FALSE

-- F-1.15-d: "אם הם מוסמכים לרובד החינוך בו הם מלמדים, בעלי תעודת הוראה או
-- בעלי תואר אקדמי" is read as three alternatives — the reading under which
-- the educational psychologists ¶18 names, who teach at no level, can meet it.
GIVEN c IS AN `incentives claimant`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `meets condition א` c IF
    `qualified for the level taught` c
    OR c's `holds a teaching certificate`
    OR c's `holds an academic degree`

-- The other reading: the certificate and the degree restate what
-- "qualified" means, so condition א is qualification alone.
GIVEN c IS AN `incentives claimant`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `meets condition א read as qualification alone` c IF
    `qualified for the level taught` c

-- Condition ב, with note 1: living in one zone-A locality and working in
-- another (or moving between them) is decided by the department head.
@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_1_2/p20 akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_1_2/p9 akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_1_2/p23
GIVEN c IS AN `incentives claimant`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `meets condition ב` c IF
        `in national-priority zone A` (c's `locality of residence`)
    AND `in national-priority zone A` (c's `locality of work`)
    AND (    c's `locality of residence` EQUALS c's `locality of work`
          OR c's `the department head decides the claimant eligible`)

-- Condition ג, with note 3: staff of a post-primary owning body are
-- approved only if they appear in the school's profile.
@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_1_2/p21 akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_1_2/p11 akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_1_2/p25
GIVEN c IS AN `incentives claimant`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `meets condition ג` c IF
    CONSIDER c's `employed by`
    WHEN `the Ministry directly` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `a post-primary owning body within the profile` THEN c's `appears in the school profile`
    WHEN `a body of recognised education` THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

-- Note 4. F-1.15-e: "במחצית המשרה לפחות במהלך כל שנת הלימודים" is read as
-- at least half a position at every point of the year; the parenthesis
-- "(50% של משרה שנתית)" also reads as an annual average.
@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_1_2/p12 akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_1_2/p26
GIVEN c IS AN `incentives claimant`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `meets the half-position condition` c IF
    c's `lowest position fraction in the year` AT LEAST 0.5

GIVEN c IS AN `incentives claimant`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `meets the half-position condition read as an annual average` c IF
    c's `annual position fraction` AT LEAST 0.5

GIVEN c IS AN `incentives claimant`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `incentives share for the position` c IS
    IF `meets the half-position condition` c
    THEN min (c's `annual position fraction`) 1
    ELSE 0

@export default Whether a teaching or education staff member is eligible for the incentives of section 1.15 (national-priority zone A)
GIVEN c IS AN `incentives claimant` @desc the staff member
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `eligible for incentives` c IF
        `in a group the incentives cover` c
    AND `meets condition א` c
    AND `meets condition ב` c
    AND `meets condition ג` c
    AND `meets the half-position condition` c

§§ `1.15.1 the notes`

-- Note 2: receipt is limited to the time the claimant works and lives in a
-- listed locality; leaving the locality or stopping work cancels it.
@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_1_2/p10 akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_1_2/p24
GIVEN c IS AN `incentives claimant`
      `still lives in the locality` IS A BOOLEAN
      `still works` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the incentives continue` c `still lives in the locality` `still works` IF
    `eligible for incentives` c AND `still lives in the locality` AND `still works`

-- Note 2's duty to notify a change "בכתב". The text sets no period: it is
-- an input here, not a number of this file.
GIVEN `notice period` IS A NUMBER @desc days allowed for the notice; section 1.15 sets none
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `incentives action`
DECIDE `notice of a change of workplace or residence` `notice period` IS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MUST  `notify the district incentives department in writing of a change`
    WITHIN `notice period`
    LEST BREACH BY `the teaching employee` BECAUSE "§1.15.1 note 2: a change of workplace or residence must be notified in writing"

@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_1_2/p13 akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_1_2/p27
GIVEN `kind` IS AN `incentive kind`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `part of the salary for pension and severance pay` `kind` IF
    FALSE

DECLARE `source of a right` IS ONE OF
    `a government decision`
    `a collective agreement`

@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_1_2/p14 akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_1_2/p28
`the source of the incentives` MEANS `a government decision`

-- Note 7: the notice of cancellation goes out only with the incentives
-- division's approval. The Ministry stands for its district office.
@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_1_2/p15 akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_1_2/p29
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `incentives action`
DECIDE `no cancellation without the division's approval` IS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    SHANT `notify the teacher that the incentives are cancelled without the division's approval`
    WITHIN `31 August 2004`
    LEST BREACH BY `the Ministry of Education` BECAUSE "§1.15.1 note 7: notice of cancellation only with the incentives division's approval"

@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_1_2/p16 akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_1_2/p30
GIVEN `kind` IS AN `incentive kind`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `tax is deducted from` `kind` IF
    TRUE

§§ `1.15.1 part 4 The incentives`

-- akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_1_2/p31 The heading of part 4 ("פירוט התמריצים"); no rule.

§§§ `4.1 קידום ותק`

@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_1/p1
`years of seniority advancement in zone A` MEANS 4

-- §4.1 ¶3: the advancement lasts while the claimant works and lives in a
-- listed locality; on leaving it lapses automatically and the real
-- seniority returns.
@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_1/p3
GIVEN c IS AN `incentives claimant`
      `real seniority` IS A NUMBER @desc years of seniority actually served
      `still works and lives in the locality` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `seniority recognised for pay` c `real seniority` `still works and lives in the locality` IS
    IF     `eligible for incentives` c
       AND c's `claimant grading` EQUALS `the teaching-staff grading`
       AND `still works and lives in the locality`
    THEN `real seniority` PLUS `years of seniority advancement in zone A`
    ELSE `real seniority`

-- §4.1 ¶2: the advancement applies at every seniority step; in years 33 to
-- 36 it is worth the difference between the combined salary of year 35 and
-- of year 36, times the years of advancement. "ההפרש" is read as the size of
-- the step between the two years.
@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_1/p2
GIVEN `combined salary at seniority` IS A FUNCTION FROM NUMBER TO NUMBER @desc the combined salary for each seniority year; set by the salary tables, an input
      `real seniority` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `monthly worth of the seniority advancement` `combined salary at seniority` `real seniority` IS
    IF `real seniority` AT LEAST 33 AND `real seniority` AT MOST 36
    THEN max (`combined salary at seniority` 36 MINUS `combined salary at seniority` 35)
             (`combined salary at seniority` 35 MINUS `combined salary at seniority` 36)
         TIMES `years of seniority advancement in zone A`
    ELSE `combined salary at seniority` (`real seniority` PLUS `years of seniority advancement in zone A`)
         MINUS `combined salary at seniority` `real seniority`

-- §4.1 ¶4: groups graded by grade rather than seniority (the educational
-- psychologists of the academic grading) are advanced by the money worth
-- of two grades, as the housing-and-incentives division approves.
@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_1/p4
GIVEN `salary at grade` IS A FUNCTION FROM NUMBER TO NUMBER @desc the salary for each grade of the claimant's grading; an input
      `grade` IS A NUMBER
      `approved by the division` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `monthly worth of the grade advancement` `salary at grade` `grade` `approved by the division` IS
    IF `approved by the division`
    THEN `salary at grade` (`grade` PLUS 2) MINUS `salary at grade` `grade`
    ELSE 0

§§§ `4.2 לימודים אקדמיים לקראת תארים בישראל`

DECLARE `tuition claim` HAS
    `institution recognised by the Council for Higher Education` IS A BOOLEAN
    `programme approved by the division`   IS A BOOLEAN
    `weekly study hours`                   IS A NUMBER
    `field is a school subject or general education` IS A BOOLEAN
    `studies toward a degree`              IS A BOOLEAN
    `request filed at the district office on its form` IS A BOOLEAN
    `receives a teacher-training hours grant` IS A BOOLEAN
    `at an Israeli branch of a foreign university` IS A BOOLEAN
    `studies abroad`                       IS A BOOLEAN
    `at the Open University`               IS A BOOLEAN
    `Open University courses toward a degree this year` IS A NUMBER
    `tuition charged`                      IS A NUMBER @desc tuition for the year, without fees, exam fees or arrears
    `registration fees, exam fees and arrears` IS A NUMBER
    `annual tuition`                       IS A NUMBER @desc the institution's tuition for one year
    `school year studied begins on`        IS A NUMBER @desc days from 1 September 2003

-- F-1.15-j: the Open University's "two academic courses" (note 3) is read
-- as standing in for the six weekly hours, which its courses are not
-- counted in; the other reading asks both.
@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_2__para_3
GIVEN t IS A `tuition claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `meets the study-load condition` t IF
    IF t's `at the Open University`
    THEN t's `Open University courses toward a degree this year` AT LEAST 2
    ELSE t's `weekly study hours` AT LEAST 6

GIVEN t IS A `tuition claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `meets the study-load condition read as both` t IF
        t's `weekly study hours` AT LEAST 6
    AND (NOT t's `at the Open University` OR t's `Open University courses toward a degree this year` AT LEAST 2)

-- Note 2 (from 1.9.02) and note 4.
@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_2__para_2
GIVEN t IS A `tuition claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `barred as a foreign university's branch` t IF
    t's `at an Israeli branch of a foreign university` AND t's `school year studied begins on` AT LEAST `1 September 2002`

@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_2__para_4
GIVEN t IS A `tuition claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `barred as study abroad` t IF
    t's `studies abroad`

-- Note 1: an hours grant from the teacher-training division does not bar
-- the refund ("זכאים אפוא לקבל גם").
@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_2__para_1
GIVEN t IS A `tuition claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an hours grant bars the tuition refund` t IF
    FALSE

@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_2/p1
GIVEN c IS AN `incentives claimant`
      t IS A `tuition claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to tuition participation` c t IF
        `eligible for incentives` c
    AND t's `institution recognised by the Council for Higher Education`
    AND t's `programme approved by the division`
    AND `meets the study-load condition` t
    AND t's `field is a school subject or general education`
    AND t's `studies toward a degree`
    AND t's `request filed at the district office on its form`
    AND NOT `barred as a foreign university's branch` t
    AND NOT `barred as study abroad` t

-- 75% of tuition (note 5: not of fees, exam fees or arrears, and never more
-- than a year's tuition).
@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_2__para_5
GIVEN c IS AN `incentives claimant`
      t IS A `tuition claim`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `tuition participation` c t IS
    IF `entitled to tuition participation` c t
    THEN min (0.75 TIMES t's `tuition charged`) (t's `annual tuition`)
    ELSE 0

-- akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_2/p2 The heading "הערות"; no rule.

§§§ `4.3 השתתפות בשכר דירה`

@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_3/p1
DECLARE `kind of landlord` IS ONE OF
    `Amidar or Amigur`
    `a local authority`
    `another public landlord`
    `the free market`

DECLARE `rent claim` HAS
    `annual rent paid`                      IS A NUMBER @desc rent for the 12 months of the school year
    `landlord`                              IS A `kind of landlord`
    `annual Amidar rent in the locality`    IS A NUMBER @desc Amidar's rent for a like flat in the locality; an input
    `maximum participation for the year`    IS A NUMBER @desc the maximum set for the school year; an input
    `in a locality of housing distress`     IS A BOOLEAN @desc Eilat, Arad and the like, where rents are among the highest
    `rate set by the committee`             IS A NUMBER @desc the share the committee headed by the division's director sets there; an input
    `owns another flat in the locality or the zone` IS A BOOLEAN @desc in the claimant's name or the spouse's
    `receives rent participation from another body` IS A BOOLEAN
    `rents from a first-degree relative`    IS A BOOLEAN @desc father/mother, son/daughter, brother/sister, son- or daughter-in-law, grandparent, the spouse's too
    `months rented in the school year`      IS A NUMBER
    `sold a flat inside the zone since התשנ"ח` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_3__para_1
GIVEN c IS AN `incentives claimant`
      r IS A `rent claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `meets the rent conditions of note 1` c r IF
        `qualified for the level taught` c
    AND `in national-priority zone A` (c's `locality of residence`)
    AND c's `locality of residence` EQUALS c's `locality of work`
    AND NOT r's `owns another flat in the locality or the zone`

@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_3__para_2
GIVEN r IS A `rent claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `barred by participation from another body` r IF
    r's `receives rent participation from another body`

@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_3__para_3
GIVEN r IS A `rent claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `barred as renting from a relative` r IF
    r's `rents from a first-degree relative`

@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_3__para_4
GIVEN r IS A `rent claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `rents for long enough` r IF
    r's `months rented in the school year` AT LEAST 6

@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_3__para_5
GIVEN r IS A `rent claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `barred as having sold a flat in the zone` r IF
    r's `sold a flat inside the zone since התשנ"ח`

GIVEN c IS AN `incentives claimant`
      r IS A `rent claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to rent participation` c r IF
        `meets the rent conditions of note 1` c r
    AND NOT (r's `landlord` EQUALS `the free market`)
    AND NOT `barred by participation from another body` r
    AND NOT `barred as renting from a relative` r
    AND `rents for long enough` r
    AND NOT `barred as having sold a flat in the zone` r

-- §4.3 ¶1: 80% of the rent, over the year's total for 12 months, capped by
-- the year's maximum; in localities of housing distress the committee sets
-- the rate instead, and the cap is not read as applying there.
-- F-1.15-i: the 80% is read as of the rent the claimant pays ("80% מגובה
-- שכר הדירה"); the paragraph also says the participation "is based on
-- Amidar's rents in the locality".
@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_3/p1
GIVEN c IS AN `incentives claimant`
      r IS A `rent claim`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `annual rent participation` c r IS
    IF NOT `entitled to rent participation` c r
    THEN 0
    ELSE IF r's `in a locality of housing distress`
         THEN r's `rate set by the committee` TIMES r's `annual rent paid`
         ELSE min (0.8 TIMES r's `annual rent paid`) (r's `maximum participation for the year`)

GIVEN c IS AN `incentives claimant`
      r IS A `rent claim`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `annual rent participation on Amidar's rents` c r IS
    IF NOT `entitled to rent participation` c r
    THEN 0
    ELSE min (0.8 TIMES r's `annual Amidar rent in the locality`) (r's `maximum participation for the year`)

-- Paid in 12 equal monthly instalments: time here is in months.
GIVEN `instalment` IS A NUMBER
      `instalments left` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `incentives action`
DECIDE `the rent instalments` `instalment` `instalments left` IS
    IF `instalments left` GREATER THAN 0
    THEN PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
         MUST  `pay a rent instalment` `amount paid`
               PROVIDED `amount paid` AT LEAST `instalment`
         WITHIN 1
         HENCE `the rent instalments` `instalment` (`instalments left` MINUS 1)
         LEST BREACH BY `the Ministry of Education` BECAUSE "§4.3: the rent participation is paid in 12 equal monthly instalments"
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_3/p2 The heading "הערות"; no rule.

§§§ `4.4 הצטרפות לקרנות ההשתלמות`

@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_4__para_a
DECLARE `fund group` IS ONE OF
    `teaching staff`
    `informal-education staff`
    `educational psychologists`

DECLARE `who pays the fund contributions` IS ONE OF
    `the division pays both parts`
    `the employer pays both parts and the division refunds it the employee's part`

DECLARE `fund member` HAS
    `member group`                          IS A `fund group`
    `joined one of the four teachers' training funds` IS A BOOLEAN
    `filed a personal joining request with the district division` IS A BOOLEAN
    `approved by the incentives division`   IS A BOOLEAN
    `member age`                            IS A NUMBER
    `left residence or work in the locality` IS A BOOLEAN
    `years from the first incentive saving to leaving` IS A NUMBER
    `annual position fraction while saving` IS A NUMBER

-- 4.4א with ג: for teaching staff the division pays both the employee's
-- and the employer's contributions, once the personal request is filed.
@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_4__para_a akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_4__para_c
GIVEN c IS AN `incentives claimant`
      m IS A `fund member`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the division bears the fund contributions` c m IF
        m's `member group` EQUALS `teaching staff`
    AND `eligible for incentives` c
    AND m's `joined one of the four teachers' training funds`
    AND m's `filed a personal joining request with the district division`

-- 4.4ב: in the zones the employer's part is free of income tax; the
-- employee's part, paid by the employer, is an imputed benefit.
@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_4__para_b
GIVEN `employer's part` IS A NUMBER
      `employee's part paid by the employer` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `income imputed for tax` `employer's part` `employee's part paid by the employer` IS
    `employee's part paid by the employer`

-- 4.4ד: "מתבקשים" — staff reaching 53 are ASKED to move to a shortened
-- fund; the text attaches nothing to not doing so.
@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_4__para_d
GIVEN m IS A `fund member`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `asked to move to a shortened fund` m IF
    m's `member age` AT LEAST 53

-- 4.4ה: leaving residence or work in the locality, for any reason, before
-- five years from the first saving stops the arrangement, and the division
-- recovers from the fund everything it paid.
@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_4__para_e
GIVEN m IS A `fund member`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the division recovers its payments under 4.4ה` m IF
    m's `left residence or work in the locality`
    AND m's `years from the first incentive saving to leaving` LESS THAN 5

-- The declaration 4.4ה makes the employee sign adds a third ground:
-- working less than 50% of an annual position (F-1.15-k).
@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_4__para_e/p2
GIVEN m IS A `fund member`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the Ministry recovers its payments under the declaration` m IF
       (m's `left residence or work in the locality`
        AND m's `years from the first incentive saving to leaving` LESS THAN 5)
    OR m's `annual position fraction while saving` LESS THAN 0.5

GIVEN `notice period` IS A NUMBER @desc days allowed; the declaration sets none
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `incentives action`
DECIDE `the declared notice of a change` `notice period` IS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MUST  `notify the fund and the division in writing of a change`
    WITHIN `notice period`
    LEST BREACH BY `the teaching employee` BECAUSE "§4.4ה declaration: every change of residence or workplace is notified in writing to the fund and the division"

-- 4.4ה ¶3: a request filed BEFORE ו' בטבת התשס"ד (31.12.2003) joins from
-- the start of התשס"ד; one filed from ז' בטבת to כו' בסיון (1.1.2004 to
-- 15.6.2004) joins from 1.1.2004. F-1.15-h: 31.12.2003 itself is in
-- neither window; the reading adopted takes "לפני" as "by", inclusive.
@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_4__para_e/p3
GIVEN `day filed` IS A NUMBER @desc days from 1 September 2003
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in the first joining window as printed` `day filed` IF
    `day filed` LESS THAN `31 December 2003`

GIVEN `day filed` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in the second joining window` `day filed` IF
    `day filed` AT LEAST `1 January 2004` AND `day filed` AT MOST `15 June 2004`

GIVEN `day filed` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `fund membership runs from` `day filed` IS
    IF `day filed` AT MOST `31 December 2003` THEN `1 September 2003`
    ELSE `1 January 2004`

GIVEN `day filed` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the joining request is in time` `day filed` IF
    `day filed` AT MOST `15 June 2004`

`a request filed on 31 December 2003 falls in neither window` MEANS
    NOT `in the first joining window as printed` `31 December 2003`
    AND NOT `in the second joining window` `31 December 2003`
#ASSERT `a request filed on 31 December 2003 falls in neither window`

-- 4.4ה ¶4–¶5: informal-education staff (shortened funds "מקור" and
-- "מישור") and educational psychologists (the academics' fund), resident
-- (and, for psychologists, working) in the zones and approved by the
-- division: the employer pays both parts and the division refunds it the
-- employee's part.
@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_4__para_e/p4 akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_4__para_e/p5
GIVEN g IS A `fund group`
GIVETH A `who pays the fund contributions`
DECIDE `the payer of the fund contributions` g IS
    CONSIDER g
    WHEN `teaching staff` THEN `the division pays both parts`
    OTHERWISE `the employer pays both parts and the division refunds it the employee's part`

§§§ `4.5 הוצאות נסיעה של מורים משתלמים בשנת שבתון`

@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_5/p1
DECLARE `sabbatical traveller` HAS
    `approved for a sabbatical within the incentives` IS A BOOLEAN
    `still lives in zone A`                IS A BOOLEAN
    `average position fraction in the training grant` IS A NUMBER
    `fare to the place of study and back`  IS A NUMBER @desc public-transport fare (intercity lines only, by private car); an input
    `fare to the nearest university and back` IS A NUMBER @desc an input
    `study days this week with six hours`  IS A NUMBER
    `share of the training hours`          IS A NUMBER @desc note 3's proportion to the training hours; how it is measured is not stated, an input
    `travel approved by the incentives division` IS A BOOLEAN

-- §4.5 ¶1: teaching-grading staff only (supervisors, principals, teachers,
-- kindergarten teachers, instructors), on conditions 1–3.
@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_5/p1 akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_5/p2 akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_5/p3 akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_5/p4
GIVEN c IS AN `incentives claimant`
      s IS A `sabbatical traveller`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to sabbatical travel` c s IF
        c's `claimant grading` EQUALS `the teaching-staff grading`
    AND (   c's `claimant role` EQUALS `supervisor`
         OR c's `claimant role` EQUALS `school principal`
         OR c's `claimant role` EQUALS `teacher`
         OR c's `claimant role` EQUALS `kindergarten teacher`
         OR c's `claimant role` EQUALS `instructor`)
    AND s's `approved for a sabbatical within the incentives`
    AND s's `still lives in zone A`
    AND s's `average position fraction in the training grant` AT LEAST 0.5

-- Note 1: only as far as the nearest university.
@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_5/p6
GIVEN s IS A `sabbatical traveller`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `fare reimbursed per trip` s IS
    min (s's `fare to the place of study and back`) (s's `fare to the nearest university and back`)

-- Note 2. F-1.15-n: "לפי תחשיב של 6 שעות שבועיות של לימודים באותו יום ולא
-- יותר מפעמיים בשבוע" is read as: a day counts if it holds six hours of
-- study, at most two days a week.
@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_5/p7
GIVEN s IS A `sabbatical traveller`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `trips reimbursed this week` s IS
    min (s's `study days this week with six hours`) 2

-- The other reading: six weekly hours of study, wherever they fall, buy up
-- to two trips. For two days of three hours each:
GIVEN `days of study` IS A NUMBER
      `hours each day` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `trips reimbursed read as six weekly hours` `days of study` `hours each day` IS
    IF `days of study` TIMES `hours each day` AT LEAST 6 THEN min `days of study` 2 ELSE 0

-- Note 3: in proportion to the position and to the training hours, after
-- the incentives division approves.
@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_5/p8
GIVEN c IS AN `incentives claimant`
      s IS A `sabbatical traveller`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `travel reimbursed this week` c s IS
    IF `entitled to sabbatical travel` c s AND s's `travel approved by the incentives division`
    THEN `trips reimbursed this week` s TIMES `fare reimbursed per trip` s
         TIMES min (s's `average position fraction in the training grant`) 1
         TIMES s's `share of the training hours`
    ELSE 0

-- Note 4. F-1.15-g: the cut-off, 15.7.2003, is before the 1.9.2003 the
-- system starts on, while ¶7 sends sabbatical travel to this note as its
-- own deadline.
@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_5/p9
GIVEN `day received` IS A NUMBER @desc the day the travel report reached the fund, from 1 September 2003
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the fund honours the travel report` `day received` IF
    `day received` AT MOST `15 July 2003`

`no report of a trip made after the system starts is honoured` MEANS
    NOT `the fund honours the travel report` `1 September 2003`
#ASSERT `no report of a trip made after the system starts is honoured`

-- akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_5/p5 The heading "הערות"; no rule.

§§§ `5 מורים צפוניים המלמדים ביישובי הבדואים בדרום`

-- akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_5/p10 The heading of part 5, northern teachers in the Bedouin localities of the south (printed in the run of 4.5's notes); no rule.
-- akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_5/p11 The heading "1. כללי"; no rule.

-- ¶12: the benefits come from the wage agreements of התשנ"ד–התשנ"ה.
@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_5/p12
DECLARE `northern benefit` IS ONE OF
    `rent participation for northern teachers`
    `the employee's fund part paid by the employer`

`the benefits of northern teachers` MEANS
    LIST `rent participation for northern teachers`, `the employee's fund part paid by the employer`

GIVEN b IS A `northern benefit`
GIVETH A `source of a right`
DECIDE `the source of a northern benefit` b IS `a collective agreement`

-- F-1.15-m: note 6 says the incentives are a government decision and not
-- of the collective agreements; the northern benefits, listed among them,
-- are given "במסגרת הסכמי השכר".
`a benefit listed among the incentives comes from a collective agreement` MEANS
        NOT (`the source of the incentives` EQUALS `a collective agreement`)
    AND any (GIVEN b YIELD `the source of a northern benefit` b EQUALS `a collective agreement`)
            `the benefits of northern teachers`
#ASSERT `a benefit listed among the incentives comes from a collective agreement`

@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_5/p24
DECLARE `northern teacher` HAS
    `from the minority sector`              IS A BOOLEAN
    `born in a northern-district locality`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `permanent residence in the northern district` IS A BOOLEAN
    `teaches in a Bedouin locality in the south` IS A BOOLEAN
    `bought a flat in the northern district` IS A BOOLEAN
    `registered address changed to the south` IS A BOOLEAN
    `assigned for the whole school year`    IS A BOOLEAN
    `northern position fraction`            IS A NUMBER
    `filed this year's rent request with lease and identity card` IS A BOOLEAN
    `monthly rent paid in the south`        IS A NUMBER
    `paid directly by the Ministry`         IS A BOOLEAN
    `approved by the southern incentives department` IS A BOOLEAN
    `joined a training fund in the ordinary way` IS A BOOLEAN
    `applied with the fund's joining confirmation` IS A BOOLEAN
    `salary the fund deduction is taken from` IS A NUMBER

GIVEN n IS A `northern teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a northern teacher in the sense of part 5` n IF
        n's `from the minority sector`
    AND n's `born in a northern-district locality`
    AND n's `permanent residence in the northern district`

-- Note ב: entitlement does not turn on whether the employment is permanent
-- or temporary.
@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_5/p25
GIVEN n IS A `northern teacher`
      `employed permanently` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to the northern benefits` n `employed permanently` IF
        `a northern teacher in the sense of part 5` n
    AND n's `teaches in a Bedouin locality in the south`
    AND NOT `the northern benefits are cancelled` n
    AND n's `assigned for the whole school year`

-- Notes ג and ד, as printed: buying a flat in the NORTHERN district, or
-- moving the registered address from the north to the south (even without
-- buying), cancels the benefits.
@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_5/p26 akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_5/p27
GIVEN n IS A `northern teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the northern benefits are cancelled` n IF
    n's `bought a flat in the northern district` OR n's `registered address changed to the south`

-- Note ה: part-time, in proportion to the position, if assigned for the
-- whole year (assignment is a condition of entitlement above).
@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_5/p28
GIVEN n IS A `northern teacher`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `northern position share` n IS
    min (n's `northern position fraction`) 1

-- akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_5/p13 The heading "2. החזר שכר דירה"; no rule.

-- ב: the monthly amount is set from time to time under the wage
-- agreements; for התשס"ג it was 562 ₪ a month, for 12 months. Other years
-- are an input.
@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_5/p15
`the monthly northern rent amount in התשס"ג` MEANS 562
`months of northern rent participation` MEANS 12

-- א: the request is filed every year with the original lease and a copy
-- of the identity card (personal and address pages), on the southern
-- district's form. ג: rent below the amount is refunded only as paid.
@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_5/p14 akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_5/p16
GIVEN n IS A `northern teacher`
      `monthly amount for the year` IS A NUMBER @desc set from time to time under the wage agreements (562 in התשס"ג)
      `employed permanently` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `monthly northern rent refund` n `monthly amount for the year` `employed permanently` IS
    IF `entitled to the northern benefits` n `employed permanently`
       AND n's `filed this year's rent request with lease and identity card`
    THEN min (n's `monthly rent paid in the south`) `monthly amount for the year`
         TIMES `northern position share` n
    ELSE 0

DECLARE `who refunds the northern teacher` IS ONE OF
    `the Ministry refunds the teacher`
    `the employer refunds the teacher and the Ministry refunds the employer`

-- ד (rent) and ד (fund): staff not paid directly by the Ministry and
-- approved by the southern incentives department are refunded by their
-- employer, which the Ministry refunds under its settlement procedures.
@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_5/p17 akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_5/p22
GIVEN n IS A `northern teacher`
GIVETH A `who refunds the northern teacher`
DECIDE `the payer of a northern refund` n IS
    IF n's `paid directly by the Ministry`
    THEN `the Ministry refunds the teacher`
    ELSE `the employer refunds the teacher and the Ministry refunds the employer`

-- akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_5/p18 The heading "3. קרן השתלמות"; no rule.

-- א: the teacher joins the fund the ordinary way and the employee's part
-- is deducted from salary as usual; ב: the Ministry refunds it, 4.2%,
-- after the southern department approves; ג: on applying to it directly
-- with the fund's joining confirmation.
@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_5/p19 akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_5/p20 akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_5/p21
GIVEN n IS A `northern teacher`
      `employed permanently` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `northern fund refund` n `employed permanently` IS
    IF     `entitled to the northern benefits` n `employed permanently`
       AND n's `joined a training fund in the ordinary way`
       AND n's `applied with the fund's joining confirmation`
       AND n's `approved by the southern incentives department`
    THEN 0.042 TIMES n's `salary the fund deduction is taken from`
    ELSE 0

-- akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_5/p23 The heading "4. הערות"; no rule.

-- ו: northern teachers too file for התשס"ד by 15 June 2004.
@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_5/p29
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `incentives action`
DECIDE `the northern teachers' request for התשס"ד` IS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MUST  `submit the northern teacher's request`
    WITHIN `15 June 2004`
    LEST BREACH BY `the teaching employee` BECAUSE "part 5 note ו: requests for התשס\"ד by 15 June 2004"

-- akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_5/p30 The heading of §1.15.1's sources (אסמכתא); no rule.
-- akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_5/p31 A source of §1.15.1: a Director-General's circular; no rule.
-- akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_5/p32 A source of §1.15.1: a Director-General's circular; no rule.

§§ `1.15.2 אזורי עדיפות לאומית`

-- akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_5/p33 The heading of §1.15.2; no rule.

-- A locality is identified by its name as the list prints it, the
-- qualifier in brackets included ("קרני שומרון (נווה מנחם בלבד)").
@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_5/p34
DECLARE `listed locality` HAS
    `number in its list` IS A NUMBER
    `printed name`       IS A STRING
    `listed under`       IS A `zone A heading`

GIVEN h IS A `zone A heading`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `added by the government decision of 27.1.1997` h IF
    CONSIDER h
    WHEN `the zone A list` THEN FALSE
    WHEN `annex B, the cancelled zone B` THEN FALSE
    OTHERWISE TRUE

GIVEN `locality` IS A STRING @desc a locality's name as section 1.15.2 prints it
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in national-priority zone A` `locality` IF
    elem `locality` (map (GIVEN e YIELD e's `printed name`) `the localities of zone A`)

DECLARE `zone A heading` IS ONE OF
    `the zone A list`
    @ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_5/p407
    `added from Judea, Samaria and Gaza by the 27.1.1997 decision`
    @ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_5/p412
    `added in 1997, Shomron Regional Council`
    @ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_5/p433
    `added in 1997, Mateh Binyamin Regional Council`
    @ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_5/p449
    `added in 1997, Gush Etzion Regional Council`
    @ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_5/p456
    `added in 1997, Har Hevron Regional Council`
    @ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_15__ssec_4_5/p471
    `annex B, the cancelled zone B`

GIVEN `locality` IS A STRING
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in the cancelled zone B` `locality` IF
    elem `locality` (map (GIVEN e YIELD e's `printed name`) `the localities of annex B`)

-- F-1.15-l: one locality is in both lists.
`חריש is in zone A and in the cancelled zone B` MEANS
    `in national-priority zone A` "חריש" AND `in the cancelled zone B` "חריש"
#ASSERT `חריש is in zone A and in the cancelled zone B`

-- And it is the only one.
`the localities in both lists` MEANS
    filter (GIVEN n YIELD `in the cancelled zone B` n)
           (map (GIVEN e YIELD e's `printed name`) `the localities of zone A`)
#ASSERT `the localities in both lists` EQUALS LIST "חריש"

-- Each list numbers its rows 1, 2, 3 … without a gap or a repeat.
GIVEN `entries` IS A LIST OF `listed locality`
      `first` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `numbered consecutively from` `entries` `first` IF
    CONSIDER `entries`
    WHEN EMPTY THEN TRUE
    WHEN e FOLLOWED BY rest THEN
        e's `number in its list` EQUALS `first` AND `numbered consecutively from` rest (`first` PLUS 1)
#ASSERT `numbered consecutively from` `the localities of zone A` 1
#ASSERT `numbered consecutively from` `the localities of annex B` 1
#ASSERT count `the localities of zone A` EQUALS 431
#ASSERT count `the localities of annex B` EQUALS 141

