-- §4.4: a member who stays in the locality but drops to 40% of a position.
GIVEN `left` IS A BOOLEAN, `years to leaving` IS A NUMBER, `fraction while saving` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `fund member`
DECIDE `a teaching fund member` `left` `years to leaving` `fraction while saving` IS
    `fund member` WITH
        `member group`                          IS `teaching staff`
        `joined one of the four teachers' training funds` IS TRUE
        `filed a personal joining request with the district division` IS TRUE
        `approved by the incentives division`   IS TRUE
        `member age`                            IS 45
        `left residence or work in the locality` IS `left`
        `years from the first incentive saving to leaving` IS `years to leaving`
        `annual position fraction while saving` IS `fraction while saving`

`a fund member at 40%` MEANS `a teaching fund member` FALSE 0 0.4

-- F-1.15-k: 4.4ה does not recover from her; the declaration she signs does.
`4.4ה and its declaration differ on a member below half a position` MEANS
    NOT `the division recovers its payments under 4.4ה` `a fund member at 40%`
    AND `the Ministry recovers its payments under the declaration` `a fund member at 40%`
#ASSERT `4.4ה and its declaration differ on a member below half a position`
#ASSERT `the division recovers its payments under 4.4ה` (`a teaching fund member` TRUE 3 1)
#ASSERT `the division bears the fund contributions` `a teacher living and working in Ofakim` `a fund member at 40%`
#ASSERT `fund membership runs from` 100 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `fund membership runs from` 200 EQUALS 122

