    EQUALS `monthly northern rent refund` `a northern teacher in Rahat` `the monthly northern rent amount in התשס"ג` TRUE
#ASSERT `a temporary and a permanent northern teacher are refunded alike`
#ASSERT `northern fund refund` `a northern teacher in Rahat` TRUE EQUALS 420
#ASSERT `the payer of a northern refund` `a northern teacher in Rahat` EQUALS `the employer refunds the teacher and the Ministry refunds the employer`
#ASSERT `monthly northern rent refund` (`a northern teacher in Rahat who bought in the north` TRUE) `the monthly northern rent amount in התשס"ג` TRUE EQUALS 0

